{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.IdealTetVolumeChimneyBridge","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.IdealTetVolumeChimneyBridge","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.OrthoschemeTiling","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerLobachevsky"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.IdealTetVolumeChimneyBridge.blochWigner_lob_eq_hypVolume_chimney","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.IdealTetVolumeChimneyBridge.blochWigner_lob_eq_hypVolume_chimney","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/IdealTetVolumeChimneyBridge.lean#L76-L101","doc":"**The Bloch–Wigner ideal-tetrahedron volume `D(z)` equals the genuine\nhyperbolic measure of the normalized chimney over its inscribed triangle.**\n\nFor `z` in the upper half plane with acute dihedral angles, `BlochWigner_lob z`\n(= `IdealTetrahedron.volume` for the ideal tetrahedron of shape `z`) is the\n`dx dy dz / z³` measure of the concrete vertical chimney over the inscribed\ntriangle at radius `1`, in Milnor's normalized position.\n\n**Unconditional and sorry-free**; it uses no `MostowIdealTetVolume` instance.\nIt is an equality of *volumes*, not of *regions* — see the module header: it does\nNOT prove the ideal tetrahedron IS the chimney (T2 / `region_eq_chimney` stays\nopen), and it does NOT discharge `qou-krvm` (iv). ","signatureChunk":0}]}